OL,3,GNEWSAFalling between building levels a
OL,4,Acommon hazard
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe risk of falling between levels of a
OL,7,Fbuilding, electric shocks and fires are
OL,8,Fthe most common hazards found by
OL,9,Finspectors reviewing rental homes in
OL,10,FJersey.
OL,12,FA new report from the government's
OL,13,FPlanning and Building Department
OL,14,Frevealed the findings from
OL,15,Finvestigations at 716 homes between 1
OL,16,FMay 2025 and 30 April. Some were random
OL,17,Fchecks, while others came following
OL,18,Ftenant complaints.
OL,20,FOf the properties inspected, 129 were
OL,21,Ffound to have safety concerns, with 253
OL,22,Fhazards found in total.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
