OL,3,GNEWSAFalling between building levels a
OL,4,Acommon hazard
OL,5,
OL,6,FOf those, 66 homes failed basic safety
OL,7,Fchecks to make sure people did not fall
OL,8,Fbetween levels, and 42 had electrical
OL,9,Fhazards. Fire hazards were found in 24
OL,10,Fhomes.
